| Control | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| Lambda & Serverless | No Lambda functions in Phase 1 |
| ECS/EKS container security | No containers in Phase 1 (local subprocess) |
| S3 bucket policies | No S3 usage |
| RDS/DynamoDB encryption | No database |
| VPC Flow Logs | No VPC |
| AWS Config rules | No AWS resources to track |
| AgentCore Identity | Local stdio transport; no multi-agent system |
| AgentCore Observability | Not using AgentCore runtime |
| Multi-agent SigV4 signing | Single server, no agent-to-agent calls |
| Prompt-validation test suites | Server is a tool provider, not an LLM — no prompts to validate |
| Bedrock model invocation logging | No direct Bedrock calls from this server |

