## Conclusion

The SP-API MCP Server passes the publication gate with **zero Critical and zero High severity findings**. All controls relevant to a Prototype/POC workload are satisfied. Medium and Low items are clearly documented with remediation paths for when the project progresses to production deployment (Phase 3).
